{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_16_level_spst_16-01","storyGroup":"main_16","storySort":257,"storyDependence":"main_16_level_spst_16-01","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"EG-7","storyName":"来信","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"雷尔金，我们到达了那里。那个位于乌卡边境的农庄，那个整合运动所在的地方，那个温暖的……平等的理想之处。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_spst_16-01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"spst_16-01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":20,"next":22,"characters":["喜悦的农妇","担忧的老人","塔露拉","九","感染者战士","雷德","忧虑的矿工"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_66_g13_reunionfarm.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":8,"style":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sunshine_upperedge","slot":"bgover","y":"100","layer":"1"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"animtext","id":11,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_heavy","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=1>乌卡边境，荒地农庄</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":12},{"type":"animtextclean","id":13},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_093#2","duration":"1","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_004","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_093#2","focus":"n","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_004","focus":"l","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"啊……又是个晴天。我印象里这辈子真没遇上过几次像这样温暖的冬天。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"多好啊……只要种下去的这批小麦能活过冬天，中间不撞上天灾……明年我们就能彻底自给自足了！","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_093#2","focus":"r","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"担忧的老人","text":"按之前的经验看，还是别高兴得太早了……","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_093_2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_004","focus":"l","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"乐观些，婆婆！从前我们不都还以为自己无处可去，会死在荒野上吗？现在却有了农庄，有房子住，有热粥喝——","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"咦，那边好像是……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"是塔露拉小姐，还有九小姐！","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"charslot","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_hidehaystack","volume":"1","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_004","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"塔露拉小姐，你们是在帮忙拔掉杂草吗？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"塔露拉，有人在跟你说话。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#9$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"啊——","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#2$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"对，没错。是我哪里做得不对吗？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我看其他人也在做，而且这些杂草确实长得太高了，看不清麦子的生长情况。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_004","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"没有，这是对的。除掉杂草可以保证小麦有足够的养分越冬——","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"您真聪明！","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#6$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"噗。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#5$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_004","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"你们已经拔了这么多了，而且没有误伤麦苗，看来不用我帮忙了。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#2$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"在这方面，你是一位经验丰富的老师。雅各布最近怎么样了？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_004","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"托你们的福，那些新药都很有效！他已经很久没有半夜疼得从床板上掉下去了。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#2$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你也要注意防护。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_004","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"嗯，我知道的。还能和他像这样在一起，已经比我曾经所有的想象都要好了。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"喜悦的农妇","text":"谢谢你们，谢谢整合运动！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1f/Avg_avg_npc_004.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#10$1","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……不用谢。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheelfts","volume":"0.6","id":63},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"两年了，你还是没有习惯收到别人的感谢。","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"我以为你早该习以为常了。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"因为他们应该感谢的实在不是我。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"的确，当他们被团结在“整合运动”这面旗帜之下时，应该感谢的，其实是他们自己。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"从废墟里重新建立生活的能力和勇气不是谁都拥有的。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"希望他们能认识到这一点。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"在那之前，你至少该让自己在走神被发现时表现得更自然点。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我只是在想……晖洁下一次回来是什么时候。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"别告诉我你在担心她。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"她每次都或多或少会带回来一些新消息。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"天灾信使不照管我们所处的这块争议地带，普通的信使更不会路过，我们这两年陆续建立起的消息网络还不够健全。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我在等……等晖洁带来些更接近真实的东西。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"你想听到什么？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"不管是什么……我想要了解现在的乌萨斯，此时此刻，正在真实发生的事。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"你不相信我们曾经在西部看到的那些场景。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你难道相信？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"上位者施舍的一点点仁慈，就足以平息大部分怒火，就足以让遭受不公的人们忘记思考、忘记反抗。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/25/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"至少我们确实没有收到过来自矿区的求助，不管是来自西部还是更远的地方。","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"也许他们只是不知道我们的存在，或者无法到达这里。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"更何况，我们也还没有在此处建立起真正稳定的居所。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"但已经在这里的人并没有因此对我们失望。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"……可他们应该失望的，九。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"塔露拉回过头去，看着太阳高高悬挂的方向。","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"她直视那光，直到眼球刺痛。","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"background","id":115},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":116},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_leavesfalling","layer":"1","id":117},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_66_i19.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":118},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.15","yScaleFrom":"1.15","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezeblow_amb","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"br","id":121},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.6","channel":"br","fadetime":"2","id":122},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reedmarshes","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"re","id":123},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"re","fadetime":"2","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"re","fadetime":"2","id":126},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"即使是现在，我们的农庄几乎能够自给自足，一切却仍然会因为一次可能的、无人预警的天灾而顷刻间化为乌有。","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"在最开始的几个月里，我们不断经历这样的损失。在无数次的试错中，我们才来到这里，收获了这样的安宁。","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"但它毕竟是无法长久的。我也曾以为在一次次的辗转中，离开我们的同行者会比留下的更多，却没想到队伍只是越发壮大。","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"并且，那不是因为受到压迫的人变多了，而是因为选择了我们的人没有失望地离去，即使他们应该。","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我们只是尝试了主动向他们释放善意，多数人却都选择了报以始终如一的信任。","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"当活着的苦痛已经无数次压垮过这些人之后，他们贫瘠的土地上竟然还能捧出这样比黄金更宝贵的情感？","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我不能……在那些事之后，我无法想象。","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"所以，我开始思考……如果这就是事物发展的规律呢？这些最质朴的人们所相信的真理，也不过如此。","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"跌倒，而后重新站起；失败，而后从头再来。","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"你到底想说什么？","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我们还会失败，九。但我认为，现在我们已经能够不为此感到忧惧。","id":139},{"type":"dialog","id":140},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"br","fadetime":"2","id":141},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"image","id":144},{"type":"bgeffect","id":145},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_bg_66_g13_reunionfarm.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"你错了。我从未因此感到忧惧。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"可与我们同行的人曾有过。毕竟，不是所有人都像你一样，胸中总有那些远大的展望，许多人只想要看见明天的太阳。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_080","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者战士","text":"九，新的抑制剂流水线已经建成了，我们现在就投入使用吗？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_080.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"瓦利亚。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_080","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者战士","text":"嗯？","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_080.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"如果我说，我们现在要放弃这里，前往圣骏堡，你会怎么做？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_080","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者战士","text":"这还用问吗？当然是跟你们一起了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_080.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#3$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"其他人呢？","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_080","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者战士","text":"一样。我们早就知道，整合运动是不会在这里停下的。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_080.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_080","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者战士","text":"不过，最好不是所有人都走吧。现在大家都各司其职地工作一段时间了，有战斗能力的跟你们去，其他人还是可以待在后方啊。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_080.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#2$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"你说得对。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_080","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"感染者战士","text":"哼……","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/be/Avg_avg_npc_080.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"九，就像他说的那样……我觉得，现在我们也许已经准备好了——","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"准备好面对那些如今还隐藏在光鲜背后的丑恶。如果它由来已久，枝蔓庞杂，无人能够将它一次就连根拔起……","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#6$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"那我们就拔第二次、第三次……只要还有人活着，直到有人成功。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"现在我们已经知道了应该团结的人是谁，如果打破枷锁的时刻到来了，我们就应该毫不犹豫地去做。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"团结所有能够团结的人，打破所有原本不应加身的锁链……","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"我们只需等待一个时机。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":190},{"type":"charslot","id":191},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":192},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":193},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":194},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"塔露拉，九。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"有要紧的事。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"怎么了雷德？你这么紧张可不多见。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"我在农庄附近遇到了一批难民，他们说自己是从远北逃难出来的矿工，他们是为“整合运动”这个名字来的。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"我确认过身份，他们没有带武器，都是感染者——我让他们先在岗哨那里等着了，后续具体怎么做，需要你们决定。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"远北？之前我们没有得到过太多关于远北的消息，他们说的逃难又是指什么？","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1$1","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"没错，就是那个消息被封得像铁桶一样严实的远北。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"至于发生了什么，还是让亲历者来跟你说吧。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"谢谢……谢谢你们的收留……好心的女士、先生……你们就是“整合运动”吗？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我真的没有想到……雷尔金说的是真的……我的天啊……","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"别着急，我们是整合运动，我们会努力帮助每一位受苦的同胞。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1968_1#6$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔露拉","text":"能否先告诉我，你们都遭遇了什么？","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bd/Avg_avg_npc_1968_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1970_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们……","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"1","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"忧虑的矿工","text":"我们在远北……遭遇了一场屠杀……","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1970_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":228},{"type":"charslot","id":229},{"type":"background","id":230},{"type":"image","id":231}],"characters":["喜悦的农妇","担忧的老人","塔露拉","九","感染者战士","雷德","忧虑的矿工"]}